        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Features\r\n\r\nSmall estate\r\nexcellent location near all amenities.\r\ngood condition\r\nBER C - 105899215\r\n\r\nProperty Summary\r\nNo. 4 Crestfield is a well-presented three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned within a small, mature residential development close to Youghal town and its many local amenities.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 89 sq. m. / 958 sq. ft., the property was built in 2000 and offers comfortable, practical accommodation with excellent potential for a purchaser to personalise and make their own. The house has recently been freshly painted and benefits from new carpeting throughout, providing an inviting, move-in-ready setting.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a double driveway to the front, together with a useful side entrance leading to a private rear garden—an ideal space for outdoor dining, family use or further landscaping.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include double-glazed windows, oil-fired central heating and a BER rating of C. While presented in good condition, the home offers clear scope for buyers to add their own style and enhance the accommodation over time.\r\n\r\nCrestfield is conveniently located close to schools, shops, sporting facilities, cafés, restaurants and all the amenities Youghal has to offer. The town is renowned for its historic character, beautiful coastline, sandy beaches, boardwalk and wide range of leisure and tourist attractions.\r\n\r\nThis attractive home will appeal particularly to first-time buyers, families, downsizers and purchasers seeking a well-located property at an accessible price point. Early viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
